            <ArticleTitle>[Cardiotoxicity of 5-fluorouracil. Clinical picture of 4 cases and a prevention proposal].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>255-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>5-fluoro-uracil (5-FU) cardiotoxicity has been often reported during chemotherapy. We collect four atypical cases of cardiac side effects in patients treated by 5-FU for head and neck tumors. We review the literature about the subject, and we propose criteria to detect patients with a high risk level, and to prevent this adverse effect incidence.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
